barrier has the judgement "Additional organisational measures at national level may be needed to ensure appropriate involvement of competent authorities responsible for individual permits.".

barrier has the statement type "http://data.europa.eu/leg/interop-assessment#StatementTypeOrganisationBarrier".

barrier has the description "Organisational measures for a smooth cross-border digital public services delivery".

barrier has the title "Digital Permitting System".


item 1 measure is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/assessment/1/1/measure".

item 1 measure is an assessment statement.

item 1 measure has for "cav:interpretation" the resource "http://data.europa.eu/leg/interop-assessment#InterpretationPositive".

item 1 measure has the judgement "Member States shall be responsible for the development, operation, maintenance, security, and supervision of their digital permitting systems. To the extent possible, the implementation of the digital permitting systems should make use of existing Union digital infrastructures, catalogues and building blocks, including those developed under the Once-Only Technical System and its implementing acts. This would promote complementarity, interoperability and the efficient use of public resources, while avoiding duplication of existing digital solutions.".

item 1 measure has the statement type "http://data.europa.eu/leg/interop-assessment#StatementTypeOrganisationMeasure".

item 1 measure has the description "Organisational measures for a smooth cross-border digital public services delivery".

item 1 measure has the title "Digital Permitting System".


item 2 measure is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/assessment/1/2/measure".

item 2 measure is an assessment statement.

item 2 measure has for "cav:interpretation" the resource "http://data.europa.eu/leg/interop-assessment#InterpretationPositive".

item 2 measure has the judgement "The Commission shall, by means of implementing acts, establish detailed rules, technical standards, and procedures necessary to ensure the interoperability, security, and effective functioning of the digital permitting systems. The permit-granting procedures are added in the scope of Single Digital Gateway and Once-Only Technical System.".

item 2 measure has the statement type "http://data.europa.eu/leg/interop-assessment#StatementTypeSharedMeasure".

item 2 measure has the description "Measures taken to ensure a shared understanding of the data".

item 2 measure has the title "Digital Permitting System".


item 3 measure is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/assessment/1/3/measure".

item 3 measure is an assessment statement.

item 3 measure has for "cav:interpretation" the resource "http://data.europa.eu/leg/interop-assessment#InterpretationPositive".

item 3 measure has the judgement "The Commission shall, by means of implementing acts, establish detailed rules, technical standards, and procedures necessary to ensure the interoperability, security, and effective functioning of the digital permitting systems.".

item 3 measure has the statement type "http://data.europa.eu/leg/interop-assessment#StatementTypeStandardsMeasure".

item 3 measure has the description "Use of commonly agreed open technical specifications and standards".

item 3 measure has the title "Digital Permitting System".


