scenario description is, as stated in the source description:
    actions_of_rules expects answers ["description 1 produces action 1", "description 1 produces item 1 action", "description 10 produces item 10 action", "description 2 produces item 2 action", "description 3 produces item 3 action", "description 4 produces item 4 action", "description 5 produces action 2", "description 5 produces item 5 action", "description 6 produces item 6 action", "description 7 produces action 3", "description 7 produces item 7 action", "description 8 produces action 4", "description 8 produces item 8 action", "description 9 produces item 9 action"].
    actions_of_agents expects answers ["citizens acts as addressee in item 10 action", "economic operator acts as addresser in action 1", "economic operator acts as addresser in action 2", "economic operators acts as addressee in item 1 action", "economic operators acts as addressee in item 10 action", "economic operators acts as addressee in item 5 action", "european commission acts as addressee in action 3", "european commission acts as addressee in action 4", "european commission acts as addressee in item 10 action", "european commission acts as addressee in item 4 action", "european commission acts as addressee in item 6 action", "european commission acts as addressee in item 7 action", "european commission acts as addressee in item 8 action", "member state acts as addresser in action 4", "member states acts as addressee in item 1 action", "member states acts as addressee in item 10 action", "member states acts as addressee in item 2 action", "member states acts as addressee in item 3 action", "member states acts as addressee in item 5 action", "member states acts as addressee in item 6 action", "member states acts as addressee in item 8 action", "member states acts as addressee in item 9 action", "national competent authorities acts as addressee in item 1 action", "national competent authorities acts as addressee in item 10 action", "national competent authorities acts as addressee in item 2 action", "national competent authorities acts as addressee in item 3 action", "national competent authorities acts as addressee in item 7 action", "national competent authorities acts as addressee in item 9 action", "national competent authority acts as addressee in action 1", "national competent authority acts as addressee in action 2", "national competent authority acts as addresser in action 3"].

query deadlines is:
    which thing has which temporal specification as deadline.

query due_dates is:
    which agent has which action due on which date.

query due_in_2027 is:
    which agent has which action due on which date in the period from 2027-01-01 to 2027-12-31.

query must_perform is:
    which party must perform which action by which date under which rule.

query applies is:
    which rule applies to which party.

query rules_without_conditions is:
    which rule has no written conditions.

query places is:
    which rule is laid down in which place.

query addressers is:
    which agent acts as addresser in which action.

query addressees is:
    which agent acts as addressee in which action.

query beneficiaries is:
    which agent acts as beneficiary in which action.

query triggers is:
    which thing is triggered by which event.

query kinds is:
    which thing is of the kind which kind.

query rules_of_act is:
    which rule is established by the act which act.

query provisions is:
    which thing is established in which provision.

query joint_rules is:
    which rule is established in more than one provision.

query prescriptive is:
    which thing is a prescriptive rule.

query constitutive is:
    which thing is a constitutive rule.

query actions_of_rules is:
    which rule produces which action.

query actions_of_agents is:
    which agent acts as which role in which action.

query concerned_agents is:
    which rule concerns which agent.

